  "title": {
    "zh": "儿童拼插帐篷搭建套装",
    "en": "Kids Interlocking Tent Building Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款面向儿童拼插搭建场景的帐篷套装，适用于家庭亲子互动、课堂活动和主题游戏空间布置。",
    "en": "This is a tent-style interlocking building set for children, suitable for family interaction, classroom activities, and themed play-area setup."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "这是一款面向儿童拼插搭建场景的帐篷套装，适用于家庭亲子互动、课堂活动和主题游戏空间布置。",
      "该款儿童拼插帐篷搭建套装以可拼接结构为核心，适合围绕帐篷，通道与互动空间进行多形态搭建。",
      "产品可用于家庭亲子游戏，幼教活动和课程化互动道具场景，通过拼搭过程帮助提升空间认知，协作能力与动手实践体验。",
      "关键参数包括内帐材料PP、外帐材质涤纶、外帐防水指数小于1000mm。",
      "包装参数支持体积(cm³)15180、宽(cm)11.50。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This is a tent-style interlocking building set for children, suitable for family interaction, classroom activities, and themed play-area setup.",
      "This kids interlocking tent building set is designed around a modular construction structure and supports multiple layout forms for tents, tunnels.",
      "It is suitable for family parent-child play, preschool activities, and structured educational props.",
      "Key specs include Inner Tent Material: PP; Outer Tent Material: Polyester; Outer Tent Waterproof Index: Less than 1000 mm.",
      "Packaging supports Volume (cm³): 15180; Width (cm): 11.50."
    ]
  },
